<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, sorry.</font>

32
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that some eagle poop
just now?</font>

33
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing there, huh?</font>

34
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I worked up a sweat,</font>

35
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I guess I'll go home
and take a shower.</font>

36
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:55,530
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Legend of Leaf Village</font>

37
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:55,530
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Onba Existed!!</font>

38
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I worked up
a good sweat today too.</font>

39
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal, Akamaru?</font>

40
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He says you smell bad, Naruto.</font>

41
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you making sure
to take a bath?</font>

42
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be saying rude things!</font>

43
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you seriously stink.</font>

44
00:03:26,810 --> 00:03:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it...</font>

45
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The poop from the eagle
a moment ago might...</font>

46
00:03:31,690 --> 00:03:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura.</font>

47
00:03:33,230 --> 00:03:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I found a slacker
who can't get a mission!</font>

48
00:03:36,570 --> 00:03:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just...
I'm not that much a slacker!</font>

49
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems. You must've done
some reckless training.</font>

50
00:03:42,450 --> 00:03:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's ripped.</font>

51
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right. I didn't notice!</font>

52
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

53
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it to me later.
I'll sew it up for you.</font>

54
00:03:52,670 --> 00:03:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?! Really?! Really?!</font>

55
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, you're such a nice person.</font>

56
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time in my life...
you've been this nice to me!</font>

57
00:04:04,550 --> 00:04:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto. You're exaggerating.</font>

58
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:10,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

59
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Sakura?!</font>

60
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You touched my breast
just now, didn't you?!</font>

61
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't do anything like that!</font>

62
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what're those hairy hands
sticking out from your armpit?!</font>

63
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's... that?</font>

64
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

65
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your back.</font>

66
00:04:44,550 --> 00:04:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is this?!</font>

67
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a huge poop!</font>

68
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:56,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! That's some kind of creature!</font>

69
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:59,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Is it a caterpillar?!
— What?! Get it off.</font>

70
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is an animal.</font>

71
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:05,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go!</font>

72
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me a break.</font>

73
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys, have you ever heard
of the legend of Onbaa?</font>

74
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbaa?</font>

75
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never heard of it!</font>

76
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune! You don't know?</font>

77
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:38,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope. Is that legend something like
an old tale or something?</font>

78
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I thought, but...</font>

79
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long ago when I was young,
I heard about a legend...</font>

80
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A legend about a dangerous,
hairy, bear-like creature called Onbaa</font>

81
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who lived deep in the mountains
near the village...</font>

82
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:56,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One day, that idiot Jiraiya
eagerly went into the forest</font>

83
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">saying he was going to investigate
the Onbaa</font>

84
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for his summer vacation
independent research.</font>

85
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Pervy Sage?</font>

86
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:04,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

87
00:06:07,590 --> 00:06:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you an idiot?</font>

88
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you seriously think
there's an Onbaa?</font>

89
00:06:12,810 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you'll get yours when
you see my independent research!</font>

90
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who would?</font>

91
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:21,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if there were an Onbaa,
it wouldn't deal with you...</font>

92
00:06:21,650 --> 00:06:23,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it! Flat-chested girl!</font>

93
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's flat-chested?!</font>

94
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way is there such a thing
as an Onbaa!</font>

95
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:29,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wanna bet on that?</font>

96
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I'll bet!</font>

97
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:33,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I'll bet on Jiraiya.</font>

98
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I'm off to wrestle
with an Onbaa!</font>

99
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And? Did the Pervy Sage
meet an Onbaa?</font>

100
00:06:45,670 --> 00:06:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he came back three days later,</font>

101
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he said he won with
a force-out move...</font>

102
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which most likely was a lie.</font>

103
00:06:57,850 --> 00:06:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is.</font>

104
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:04,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

105
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What lousy writing!</font>

106
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're one to talk, Naruto.</font>

107
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:15,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see... The Onbaa is big.
It is nine-feet tall.</font>

108
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Onbaa is scary.</font>

109
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one is a match for it
when it gets mad.</font>

110
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I beat it at wrestling.</font>

111
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:23,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

112
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Onbaa's child likes
being carried piggyback.</font>

113
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They grow up on the parent's back.</font>

114
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

115
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:35,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Jiraiya wrote is bogus,
tracing the legend as is, but...</font>

116
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there was an Onbaa...</font>

117
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade, as for this thing,</font>

118
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it stays piggyback on my back
and won't get off.</font>

119
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?</font>

120
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to legend,
the child Onbaa considers</font>

121
00:07:49,490 --> 00:07:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the first thing it sees after birth
as its parent</font>

122
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and clings to the back
of that person.</font>

123
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they grow that way,
piggybacked on the parent,</font>

124
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until they become an adult.</font>

125
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems until then,
they never leave the parent's back.</font>

126
00:08:03,790 --> 00:08:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, there's no other way
but to wait until it grows up.</font>

127
00:08:07,130 --> 00:08:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say that, but when it grows up...</font>

128
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll turn into a scary
nine-foot tall monster, right?</font>

129
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with
that straightforward reaction?</font>

130
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's a legend,
so it'll probably get off eventually...</font>

131
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so irresponsible!</font>

132
00:08:33,650 --> 00:08:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Naruto...</font>

133
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be cheering you on
from behind the scenes.</font>

134
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come up close rather than
behind the scene, damn it!</font>

135
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

136
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose, you know!</font>

137
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't a weight, man!</font>

138
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Hinata?</font>

139
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... I heard a strange rumor.</font>

140
00:09:16,950 --> 00:09:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A strange rumor... you say?</font>

141
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you... had a child.</font>

142
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean this?</font>

143
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

144
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You okay?! Hinata!</font>

145
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, Hinata!</font>

146
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata?!</font>

147
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal?
You're sure an extravagant guy...</font>

148
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I going to have to take a bath
every time he pees on me?</font>

149
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"ICHIRAKU RAMEN"</b></font>

150
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:34,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, we don't allow pets.</font>

151
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village public health
department is strict, you see.</font>

152
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I missed dinner because of him.</font>

153
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Overlook it just for today.</font>

154
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now that I look closer,
he's cute, isn't he?</font>

155
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what's his name?</font>

156
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:52,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's saying it himself,
so I guess Onbu is okay.</font>

157
00:10:53,090 --> 00:10:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu, huh...?</font>

158
00:11:05,850 --> 00:11:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't he want to eat
some Naruto fish cake?</font>

159
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

160
00:11:18,070 --> 00:11:19,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man!
Give me a whole roll of Naruto!</font>

161
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Coming right up!</font>

162
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since you clung to my back,</font>

163
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been getting nothing
but odd jobs like this.</font>

164
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess it can't be helped...</font>

165
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gotten big...! And so quickly...</font>

166
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:11,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad!</font>

167
00:12:23,590 --> 00:12:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto,
you are assigned a mission</font>

168
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the removal of the mountain bandits
from Yamabuki Pass!</font>

169
00:12:29,470 --> 00:12:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Removal? Hey, old lady...</font>

170
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu's gotten big,</font>

171
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so you intend to get rid
of the troublemaker, right?</font>

172
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's not like that.</font>

173
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking you've had
some eye-opening growth recently, so...</font>

174
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what about the other members?</font>

175
00:12:44,530 --> 00:12:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

176
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you've shown
such remarkable growth,</font>

177
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a solo infiltration should be fine.</font>

178
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough,
it's getting rid of the troublemaker!</font>

179
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is also fate...
Okay, now, back to work.</font>

180
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, mister!</font>

181
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Naruto.</font>

182
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things are fun when
you're around, Onbu!</font>

183
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Grandma Tsunade.</font>

184
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't think you were able to
get rid of the troublemaker so easily.</font>

185
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll beat the mountain bandits
and finish up this mission lickety-split</font>

186
00:13:53,470 --> 00:13:56,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the two of us will return
to the Leaf Village with pride!</font>

187
00:13:56,810 --> 00:13:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Onbu?!</font>

188
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Mountain bandits! Come out!</font>

189
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:13,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you, creep?!</font>

190
00:14:13,830 --> 00:14:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

191
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:15,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?!</font>

192
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Uzumaki Naruto with my kid Onbu!</font>

193
00:14:19,210 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourselves!</font>

194
00:14:20,670 --> 00:14:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Say what?!
— Get him!</font>

195
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

196
00:14:32,470 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu!</font>

197
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even knowing it's a clone...</font>

198
00:14:38,730 --> 00:14:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't forgive those who hurt Onbu!</font>

199
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was that?!</font>

200
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

201
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu! You saved me!</font>

202
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu... I owe you my life.</font>

203
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get back to the village quick
and surprise everyone!</font>

204
00:15:22,690 --> 00:15:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu! No way will I believe
that you're a dangerous creature!</font>

205
00:15:28,070 --> 00:15:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll go as the Onbu-Naruto team
succeeding the Kiba-Akamaru team!</font>

206
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?</font>

207
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay...</font>

208
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:44,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got me with you.</font>

209
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu?! No, it's huge!</font>

210
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be... you're after Onbu?</font>

211
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you Onbu's mom?!</font>

212
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:17,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! I didn't steal him!</font>

213
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu! Say something, will you?!</font>

214
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot, Onbu!</font>

215
00:16:28,050 --> 00:16:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you've got the wrong idea!</font>

216
00:16:30,050 --> 00:16:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu, it's your mom.</font>

217
00:16:36,010 --> 00:16:37,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not my intention!</font>

218
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! I had a rough time of it.</font>

219
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a mother,</font>

220
00:17:09,630 --> 00:17:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then take better care
of your child, really!</font>

221
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay! I'll return Onbu to you!
So rest easy.</font>

222
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:20,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body got light.</font>

223
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:32,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu? You got so big!</font>

224
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...? What's the matter, Onbu?!</font>

225
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the deal?!</font>

226
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait... Onbu, it's me!
Can't you tell?!</font>

227
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were getting along
so well just a moment ago!</font>

228
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please remember me!</font>

229
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me! Naruto U-zu-ma-ki!</font>

230
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah! Naruto!</font>

231
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Naruto!</font>

232
00:18:21,950 --> 00:18:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu, look at this!</font>

233
00:18:24,950 --> 00:18:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember! Remember this spiral!</font>

234
00:18:29,170 --> 00:18:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Naruto!</font>

235
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You remember my back
you clung to the whole time, don't you?</font>

236
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have I... had it?</font>

237
00:19:07,870 --> 00:19:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu...</font>

238
00:19:13,590 --> 00:19:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm tired...</font>

239
00:19:24,600 --> 00:19:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feels kind of good...</font>

240
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like I'm being carried piggyback.</font>

241
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu...</font>

242
00:19:57,670 --> 00:19:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbu!</font>

243
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Live in good health with your mom.</font>

244
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

245
00:20:17,650 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sides... are splitting!</font>

246
00:20:22,070 --> 00:20:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onbaa is now no longer a legend.</font>

247
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're thriving in the village forest
and seriously proliferating.</font>

248
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The stupid eagles carried them in, so...</font>

249
00:20:34,620 --> 00:20:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! How'd you tear it off you?!
Tell me!</font>

250
00:20:38,210 --> 00:20:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows?
All I did was wrestle with Onbu.</font>

251
00:20:42,670 --> 00:20:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so mean!</font>

252
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
the village will be crushed.</font>

253
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me! Naruto!</font>

254
00:21:00,610 --> 00:21:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look at me.</font>

255
