281
00:22:26,340 --> 00:22:34,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="30"><font face="Myriad Pro Cond"><b>higawari na Jazz Guitar sotto mainaa de</b></font></font></font>

282
00:22:26,340 --> 00:22:34,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="30"><font face="Myriad Pro Cond"><b>a daily jazz guitar played in a soft minor key</b></font></font></font>

283
00:22:37,830 --> 00:22:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Shino and I have been
sent to a certain village to deal with</font>

284
00:22:39,540 --> 00:22:41,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">a dispute over a family head
who passed away.</font>

285
00:22:42,210 --> 00:22:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">An old woman suddenly appears
on the road and says this to us.</font>

286
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">"Even dead men laugh
in Motoyoshi Village"</font>

287
00:22:48,090 --> 00:22:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They were mysterious words.
I never imagined it at this time.</font>

288
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">To think I would see with
my own eyes,</font>

289
00:22:55,270 --> 00:22:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">a sight in this village too frightening
to even talk about...</font>

290
00:22:58,230 --> 00:22:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next: "Shino Laughs."</font>

291
00:23:00,060 --> 00:23:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I can't even go to the bathroom
alone at night.</font>

